---
// Quiz figure for Post 4 set 07: cash advance Thursday vs Monday for 200M VND net sale.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq04ad">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 190" role="img" aria-label="Cash advance comparison for a 200 million VND Thursday morning sale: withdrawing Thursday charges 4 calendar days (Thu, Fri, Sat, Sun) until Monday T+2 settlement at 12%/year.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Thursday 200M VND sale: cash advance vs waiting until Monday</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bán 200 triệu hôm thứ Năm: ứng trước so với đợi thứ Hai</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="126" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Advance on Thursday</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ứng tiền ngay thứ Năm</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="102">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4 calendar days (Thu→Mon)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>4 ngày lịch (T5→T2)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="132" class="qfig-m">Rate: 12% / 365 days</text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="126" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Wait until Monday 13:00</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đợi 13:00 thứ Hai (T+2)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="102">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0 advance days borrowed</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>0 ngày vay ứng trước</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="132" class="qfig-m">Advance fee: 0 VND</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq04ad { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq04ad svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq04ad text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq04ad .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
